> So far the list seems to be:

> 21064AA
No such beast.  You probably mean 21064-AA, which was the part number for a
150 MHz 21064 (i.e., not a 21064A)

> 21164A (future?)
Present.  (well, in my future)

Here's a summary of the info I have at hand:

