	4	RTS
	5	CTS
	6	DSR
	7	GND
	8	DCD
	20	DTR
	22	RI

COM2
	11	DTR
	12	DCD
	13	CTS
	14	TXD
	16	RXD
	19	RTS
	23	DSR
	25	RI

